<title>USA: Ashland Inc Q2 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Ashland Inc Q2 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>ASHLAND, Ky. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.03	 loss     $0.11</p>
<p> Net profit	7	     loss     2</p>
<p> Revs		3,243		    3,097</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  66			 64</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS Ended March 31</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.50	 profit   $1.18</p>
<p> Net profit	40	    profit   85</p>
<p> Revs		6,690		    6,270</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  66			 64</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said that for the net income and net earings per share in the 6 months period for 1996, a gain was included of $73 million resulting from a settlement of Ashland International's claims in the bankruptcy reorganiziation of Columbia Gas Transmission and Columbia Gas Systems.</p>
<p>Analyst consensus for the earnings per share or the quarter was $0.03, according to First Call.</p>
